        <mxCell id="-DPyDt0YLmDZMVS1ihkm-17" value="&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: start; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;We added the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;text-align: start; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; data-end=&quot;38&quot; data-start=&quot;13&quot;&gt;SSE gateway (Mercure)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: start; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;to improve scalability and reliability of our setup.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;text-align: start; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; data-end=&quot;94&quot; data-start=&quot;91&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: start; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;Unlike the basic server, the gateway provides built-in&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;text-align: start; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; data-end=&quot;160&quot; data-start=&quot;149&quot;&gt;pub/sub&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: start; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;functionality that lets clients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;text-align: start; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; data-end=&quot;225&quot; data-start=&quot;193&quot;&gt;subscribe to specific topics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: start; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;, making event routing more structured.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;text-align: start; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; data-end=&quot;267&quot; data-start=&quot;264&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: start; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;It also uses an internal&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;text-align: start; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; data-end=&quot;306&quot; data-start=&quot;292&quot;&gt;event loop&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: start; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;to efficiently manage thousands of open connections, supports&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;text-align: start; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; data-end=&quot;393&quot; data-start=&quot;369&quot;&gt;backpressure control&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: start; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;to handle slow consumers without exhausting memory, and enables&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;text-align: start; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; data-end=&quot;488&quot; data-start=&quot;458&quot;&gt;multiplexing and broadcast&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: start; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;— letting one server message reach many subscribers instantly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;text-align: start; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; data-end=&quot;554&quot; data-start=&quot;551&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: start; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;Finally, it adds&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;text-align: start; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; data-end=&quot;597&quot; data-start=&quot;571&quot;&gt;automatic reconnection&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: start; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;via&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;text-align: start; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; data-end=&quot;617&quot; data-start=&quot;602&quot;&gt;Last-Event-ID&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: start; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;, so clients can recover seamlessly after network interruptions.&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;align=center;fillColor=none;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontColor=light-dark(#000000,#E7E7E7);" parent="1" vertex="1">
